<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Naruthi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikitabu i Naruthi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Naruthi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Naru</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikitabu i</para>
  <para style="mt1">Naruthi</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Naelimeleki ni amuchi aya anoorwaa ukhalhani Umoabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Khalhayi vawo, ikatema owaamulha milhatu vaari aya atawaraka Uisraeli, yahokhuruwa ikuruna mwiilhaponi mmo. Ntu mmoka ukhuma Ubethlehemu, Uyudea vamoka ni ahanu awe ni achishaana awe eelhi ashilhopwana ahorwaa ukhalhani ulhetoni wiilhaponi Umoabu. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Yoyo ntu uyo eehaniya Elimeleki ni ahanu awe yeehaniya Nanaomi. Achishaana aya eelhi ashilhopwana, mmoka eehaniya Mahaloni ni nkina uyo eehaniya Kilioni. Yoyo ntu uyo vamoka ni amuchi awe yaari o nikosho na Aefrati o Ubethlehemu yo Uyudea. Yahorwaa ilhapo yo Umoabu, nkayaakhalha wowo. <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Ikatema vaari aya wowo, Naelimeleki owannyaya Nanaomi, ahorimeelha ni Nanaomi nkayaahiya ni achishaana aya eelhi ayo. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Yayo ashimirawo ayo yahaaveka imialhi o Umoabu, Orpa ni Ruthi. Chavireke iyaakha khumi, <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Mahaloni ni Kilioni ni ayo ahorimeelhacha. Nanaomi nkayaahalha veekha, ahiri ni owannyaya ama achishaana.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nanaomi ni Naruthi anoohokolhia Ubethlehemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Kaanyuma aya, Nanaomi aheewa wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku yahaavahera attu aya upatta choolhia chinchi. Paahi etu, yahothama Umoabu ni uhokolhia uwannyaya vamoka ni ashihokohi aya ayo. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Ahothama vakittu vaakhalha aya vamoka ni ashihokohi aya ayo, ulhukama uhokolhia Uyudea. <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Nansho vaachokholha aya nkwaha, Nanaomi aheerelhacha ashihokohi aya eelhi ayo wiira, “Nhokolhieke etu kila mmoka uwannyawe wa anumwanawe. Kinolhepelha wiira Apwiiya Nlhuku akhalhe o nrima woombone uwaninyu mwaatti thoko chaari inyu mwaatti ni nrima woombone uwannyaka ni wa attu aka arimelhanche alhe. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Apwiiya Nlhuku ovahereni kila mmoka inyu ampatte nlhopwana ni upatta kila mmoka inupa awe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 1:9">Yamalheke Nanaomi ahaalhehacha ni waakumbatiracha. Nansho onkhaye nkayaachokholha wulha akhuwelhachaka, <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />ni ayo nkayeeracha, “Ata mena! Hii ninouttukanani vamoka vanorwaa inyu wa attu inyu.”<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Nansho Nanaomi yahaapepechacha yeeraka wiira, “Mena! Nhokolhieke umawannyu achishaana aka. Nlhatuni no ukittwara? Chani, mwaatti nnanyihera wiira kinowooria waapatta achishaana ashilhopwana anohalha uthelhani mwaatti? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Nhokolhiacheke uwannyu achishaana aka ukhalhawaya mii kihoolhuvalha chinene vano, akinooria uvekiya tho. Ata kineeraka wiira kinookhulhuvelha, ni ata kaapattaka alhopwana o ukiveka lhelho va ni waayara ashaana ashilhopwana, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />chani nnowooria waalhita mpaka onnuwe? Chani nnowooria wiishunga wiira nhivekiye ni manyaalhopwana akina? Ihikhalhe chiicho achishaana aka! Mwaha aka uri worikarika chinene wo nlhatu winyu, ukhalhawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku ahohiyerera ukipatte wu uhuva wu.”<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Vavawo nkayaachokholhacha ukhuwelhacha ni wunlha tho. Phi vavawo tho Naorpa vaakumbatinre aya ahokohi aya, ni waalheha uhokolhia uwannyaya. Nansho Naruthi, ahohalha vamoka ni Nanaomi. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Paahi Nanaomi nkayeerelha Naruthi wiira, “Mwooneke akhunaninyu ahohokolhia uwannyaya wa anumwanaya ni wa milhuku aya. Paahi etu ni inyu nhokolhieke mwaattwareke akhunaninyu ayo.”<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Nansho Naruthi ahaakhulha wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">“Nhikipepeche wiira kuuhiyeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">ni mena nhikichiichihe uttukanani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">Uriwoothe unohalha inyu urwaa ni ukhalha uwo, ni mii kinoorwaa wowo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">unorwaa inyu ukhalha uwo, ni mii kinookhalha wowo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">ni attu inyu anookhalha phi attu aka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">ni Nlhuku inyu nookhalha Nlhuku aka.<verse eid="RUT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Vakittu vanohalha inyu ukhwelha ni mii kinookhwelha vavawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:17">phi vavawo vanokhalha aka uvithiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:17">Apwiiya Nlhuku akitwarusheke chinene yakhalhaka kinomwalhaanihiya ni inyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:17">yaahikhalhe wo nookhwa veekha aya.”<verse eid="RUT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Ni Nanaomi vonne aya wiira Naruthi ahokhanyerera waattukana vamoka uwo, ahohiya waapepecha uwo. <verse eid="RUT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Phi vavawo oyelhi vaarwelhe aya nkwaha aya mpaka Ubethlehemu. Vaapilhe aya wowo, attu onkhaye ahoomiya uwanoni ata manyoopani yahokohanacha wiira, “Chani ana alha phi Nanaomi?”<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Nanaomi nkayeera wiira, “Nhikiihane tho Naomi nkiihaneke Mara, maana aya uweria, ukhalhawaya Nlhuku o Machiri chinene hopanga ukumi aka ukhalhe wo uweria chinene. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Vaathamme aka vaa, kaari ntu o chittu chinchi, nansho vano Apwiiya Nlhuku ahokihokolhosha mathatharu. Chani woonaka nnokihaana Naomi, maana aya uvaheriya, uno Apwiiya Nlhuku anakitwarunshe, ni ayo Apwiiya Nlhuku o machiri ahohiyerera wiira kihuve?”<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Phi chiichammo etu Nanaomi vamoka ni Naruthi nthiyana Mmoabu, vaahokolhelhe aya ukhuma Umoabu, ni uphiya Ubethlehemu ikatema nlhalha wo ishayiri vaachokholha aya.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Naruthi anookumaana ni Naboazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Nanaomi ahaana alhoko aya yeehaniya Naboazi, ntu o nikosho ni Naelimeleki, owannyaya. Yoyo ari ntu ochuwania ni o nhakhu mwiichi. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Nihuku nimoka Naruthi aheerelha Nanaomi wiira, “Nkihiyeke etu kirwee kaavieavie mahalhahalha o choolhia mmamatani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:2">Nanaomi nkayaakhulha wiira, “Haya, urweeke etu mwaamwanaka.”<verse eid="RUT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Paahi Naruthi nkayaarwa umatani, nkayattwara attu yaakhungura choolhia, nkayalhokottacha machashi yaahiyachilhe aya. Kumbe nkayeephwanya anakenlhe umatani wa Naboazi, ntu o nikosho nimoka ni Naelimeleki.<verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Katashi aya, Naboazi ahowa akhumaka Ubethlehemu nkayaashikuriacha attu yaakhungura choolhia alhe yeeraka wiira, “Apwiiya Nlhuku, akhalhe vamoka ni inyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">Ni ayo nkayaakhulhacha, “Apwiiya Nlhuku ovaherekeni.”<verse eid="RUT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Paahi Naboazi nkayankoha ntu eemelhelha attu yaakhungura choolhia ayo, “Ulhe mwalhi ulhe phi mpani?” <verse eid="RUT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Ntu eemelhelha attu akina uyo nkaakhulha, “Yoyo mwalhi Mmoabu, wiilhe vamoka ni Nanaomi ukhuma Umoabu. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Ahokilhepelha wiira avire attwaraka utulhi attu anokhungura choolhia ayo, avire arokottaka mahalhahalha o choolhia. Paahi wiilhe toka wichishu ni uvara ntheko, nansho vano tu phi rweelhe awe uwiittuwani vanrapattani valhe.”<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Phi vavawo Naboazi verenlhe aya Naruthi wiira, “Wiiweke mwaamwanaka, uhirwee uurokottani machashi ukina ihikhalhe ilha imata ilha vekha. Waattukaneke alha imialhi ilha. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Tho, uweheke vanovara aya ntheko ni uwe wiithakaniheke mwa manyaathiyana mmo. Kihaamuka ashimirawo alha wiira ahuhuviheni. Wawolhiyaka nttona, urweeke vamiapuni vawo wawurieke maashi arikachilhe aya ashimirawo ayo.”<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Vavawo Naruthi nkayaakhoroma waakhoromelha Naboazi mpaka vathi wo wiitimarikha, ni wiira, “Nlhatuni no ukoonelha ikiriri thoko chiicho? Woonaka nnokichukulhelha chiicho ni mii kinari nlheto?”<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Nansho Naboazi nkayaakhulha, “Kiheewa mwaha wonkhaye waapangenlhe inyu ahokohi inyu toka varimeelhe aya owannyu. Kihochuwelha chinre inyu wo waahiya manyanaangoro inyu, nkamwaahiya ilhapo inyu nkamwaawa uukhalhani wa attu mwahaachuwenlhe inyu khalhayi. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Apwiiya Nlhuku oocharihelhekeni wo nlhatu wo chilha chonkhaye chipangilhe inyu chi. Apwiiya Nlhuku o Israeli mwaattawenlhe inyu ovahekeni nttuvo nitiminre.”<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Naruthi nkayaakhulha, “Athumwanaka, inyuva nhokipangelha moombone chinene. Ata inakhalhaka wiira mii akirii thoko mmoka a anamitheko inyu, kihoteelhiya ukhalhawaya nhokiteelhiha nrima ni ukoopana mwaha wo nrima woombone.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Ikatema yaalhiya yolhia, Naboazi aheehanelha Naruthi yiiraka wiira, “Kharibu vaa, mmweeke mwaalhia nkatte ni upapha munhuchini.” Paahi Naruthi ahonkoma vamoka ni attu aakhungura choolhia. Ni Naboazi ahaavaha Naruthi yolhia yo waarikiya nkayaalhia, nkayaawona mpaka uhiya. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Nkayaakhalha wiira Naruthi vaathempe aya urokottacha choolhia, Naboazi aheerelhacha anamitheko aya wiira, “Mwaahiyeke arokotteke ata weeshiye ihiru uwo wala nhaachiichihe. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Wo uthepa vavawo, ntholholheke machashi nttuke inyu mmatiitani ayo mwaahiyeke awieke wala nhaachiichihe.”<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Paahi Naruthi ahorokotta machashi mpaka uchechilho. Vaamalhinhe aya weepetta ishayiri ahopatta wo upwaha isaado imoka. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Amalhihekeru ahokusha ishayiri yaapante aya nkaarwana uwani nkayooniha ahokohi aya. Tho ahokumiha ni yolhia yaahalhinhe aya vaalhilhie aya nkayaawona, ni waavaha. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Paahi ahokohi aya ayo nkayaakoha, “Nrokontte vayi ishayiri yonkhaye ilha? Kwaani mwaari umatani wa apani? Apuhihiyeke yayo ohiyerenreni ayo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Vavawo Naruthi nkayaahimeria Nanaomi wiira aavanre ntheko umatani wa ntu eehaniya Naboazi. <verse eid="RUT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Paahi Nanaomi nkayeerelha ahokohi aya wiira, “Apwiiya Nlhuku aavahereke yayo Naboazi ayo! Nlhuku o mahuku o uhimalha nootimiriha malhehano awe wa attu akumi ni attu akhwilhe.” Nkayaathepa tho wulhumacha wiira, “Yoyo ntu uyo nlhoko ihu ni uyo phi mmoka a attu anothananiya unilhelha hii.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Paahi Naruthi, ntu o Umoabu, nkayeera, “Tho, ahokiirelha wiira, kiithakaniheke ni imialhi anovara ntheko wo ukhungura choolhia chaya ayo mpaka vanohalha aya umalhiha ukhungura choolhia chonkhaye.”<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Paahi Nanaomi nkayeerelha Naruthi wiira, “Eiyo mwaamwanaka. Vahorera uvara ntheko vamoka ni imialhi akina mmatani mwa Naboazi mmo, ukhalhawaya veekinaka mwanhuvihiya mwakaarweelhe umatani wa ntu nkina.”<verse eid="RUT 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Paahi etu, Naruthi nkaavara ntheko vamoka ni yayo imialhi anamitheko a Naboazi ayo, nkayaarokottacha machashi mpaka vaamanlhe aya nlhalha wo ishayiri ni ingaano. Wo mahuku onkhaye ayo yaari akhalhaka ni ahokohi aya ayo.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Naruthi anoovekiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Yavireke mahuku, Nanaomi aheerelha ahokohi aya, Naruthi wiira, “Anaaka, kihothananiya uwaaveriani alhopwana o uvekani wiira nkhalhe ni inupa inyu. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Paahi etu vano alha Naboazi alha, mwaapangelhe inyu ntheko vamoka ni imialhi akhunaninyu alha, yayo o nihimo nihu! Paahi etu nkiiweke. Uchechilho anorwaa weepettani ishayiri. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Vavawo etu, nkhucheke, mwooteke makhura o nukhelha ni uwarelha. Nrweeke vakittu vaneepettelha aya ishayiri vawo, nansho nhiichoonihe chitema mpaka vanohalha aya umalhiha ulhia ni uwuria. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Tho, nchuwelheke vakittu vanohalha aya urupa. Vanohalha aya uhichilha vawo, nrweeke mwiithaka, mwaapatakulheke umietoni mwarupeke vavawo. Ni ayo anokouhimeriani ittu yo upanga.”<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Naruthi nkayaakhulha, “Kinoopanga choothene thoko chinre inyu wo ukihimeria chiyo.”<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Paahi etu Naruthi ahorwaa vakittu veepettiya ishayiri, nkayaapanga thoko chaalheheriye aya ni ahokohi aya chiyo. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Naboazi vaamalhinhe aya ulhia ni uwuria, ahoteelhiya munrimani, nkayoona wiitho uwo aayee. Nkayaarwa vaari ntita no ishayiri nkayaarupa. Naruthi nkayaarwa yiithaka nkayaapatakulha umietoni u Naboazi nkayaarupa vavawo. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Uhiyu iriyari Naboazi ahothuthuwa, nkayaarukunuwa ni ushanga umwoona nthiyana narumpe umietoni waya. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Nkayaakoha, “Inyuva phi apani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">Naruthi nkayaakhulha, “Miyaano Ruthi, namitheko inyu. Nkikhunelheke ikuwo inyu iyo mii namitheko inyu, ukhalhawaya inyuva phi alhoko aya owannyaka akhwilhe, nnothananiya ukelha manupa.”<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Naboazi nkayeera, “Apwiiya Nlhuku ovaherekeni ibarakha ukhalhawaya wo chilha chonkhaye chinopanga inyu nnowooniha umanya upwaha ata chipangilhe inyu wa ahokohi inyu ukhalhawaya khamwaanvie ashimirawo amashikini ama o nhakhu wiira oovekeni. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Vano etu Naruthi nhikelhiye nipampa, kinoupangelhani ittu iriyoothe inohalha inyu ulhepelha ukhalhawaya kila ntu vawanihu va, hochuwelha nrima woombone urina inyu. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Irii wo ikekhiaye wiira mii phi nothananiya uulhelhani inyuva, nansho haawo tho nothananiya uulhelhani, ri vakhiviru ni inyu ukipwaha mii. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Paahi etu nkhalheke vaa uhiyu wonkhaye ulha, washaakaru ninowoona wiira noorumelhelha uulhelhani ama kuhiwe. Arumelhelhaka uulhelhani, aye, nansho akhotaka mii kinoulhelhani. Nrupeke vaa etu mpaka wichishu.”<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Paahi Naruthi nkayaarupa umietoni vawo mpaka wichishu, nansho yonkwilhe mapikosha wiira ahooniye, ukhalhawaya Naboazi khayaattunne attu achuwelhe wiira Naruthi yaarumpe vavawo veepettelhiya ishayiri vawo. <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Naboazi nkayeerelha Naruthi wiira, “Mwaathalheke ikuwo mwiikhunenlhe inyu iyo vathi vawo.” Naruthi nkayaathalha. Naboazi nkayaahelhelha ishayiri n'debe nimoka, nkayaaria vamuruni wiira akusheke uwannyaya. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Vaapilhe aya vawani, ahokohi aya yahaakoha, “Yeerelhe chani anaaka?” Naruthi nkayaahimiacha mwaha wonkhaye upangilhe aya ni Naboazi. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Nkayaahimiachera tho wiira, “Ahokihimeria wiira, kihihokolhie wa ahokohi aka mathatharu, paahi etu phi kivahilhe aya ishayiri n'debe nimoka.”<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Nanaomi nkayeera wiira, “Vano mmaalheke etu anaaka mpaka vanohalha inyu woona ittu inohalha ukhumelhelha. Naboazi anoothemwa lhelho mpaka vanohalha aya utimiriha malhove aya onkhaye.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Naboazi anowaaveka Naruthi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Naboazi yahorwaa waari ipuwa yo ukumaaniya unlhakoni muulhupalhe wo ukelhelha vawani, nkayonkoma vathi. Yeereke chiicho, nhima aya Naelimeleki aahimiachiye ni Naboazi ulhe ahovira vakhiviru ni vavawo. Naboazi nkayaamwiihana, nkayeera wiira, “Uweeke wonkoma vaa mwanhima aka.” Paahi yoyo ntu uyo ahowa nkonkoma vavawo. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Phi vavawo Naboazi veehanne aya ashulhupalhe khumi o iwani iyo, nkayaalhepelha ni ayo wiira onkomache vavawo. Nkayonkomacha. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Tho phi vavawo Naboazi venrenlhe aya ahima aya alhe, “Vano etu Nanaomi ahokolhelhe ukhuma Umoabu alha, anothana uthumiha imata yaari ya alhoko ihu Naelimeleki. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Paahi mii kihoona nambaya kuuhimerieni yoyo mwaha uyo. Paahi etu yakhalhaka nnoothanana yeyo imata iyo, moopolheke nkusheke, ashulhupalhe aka alha yoonaka. Mwathananaka ama mwaahithananeke muulhumacheke etu ukhalhawaya ntu nothananiya uchokholha woopolha phi inyuva, ni mii kikhalheke o nayelhi inyuva mwoochelhaka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">Yoyo nhima aya uyo ahaakhulha eeraka, “Mii kinowoopolha etu.”<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Naboazi nkayeera, “Aye, nansho mwoopolhaka yeyo imata iyo ukhuma wa Nanaomi, paahi nnowoopolha ni Naruthi, nankhwelhi Mmoabu uyo, wiira imata iyo ihalheke mmathathani mwa amuchi a nlhoko ihu khwilhe ulhe.”<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Yoyo ntu aari mmuchi uyo nkaakhulha, “Yakhalhaka chiicho etu, akinoopolha imata iyo, ukhalhawaya achishaana aka khanowa aapatta mahalha o uhiyeriya. Nambaya yeyo imata iyo kuuvahekeni inyuva, ukhalhawaya mii akooriaka woopolha imata iyo.”<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Yayo mahuku ayo, Uisraeli, attu vaathanana aya woopolha ama waakakhana ittu, yaari phi malhemalhelho wa ntu wooniha nthonyero no urulha iratu awe ni ummaha ntu nkina. Wo yeyo iphiro iyo attu o Uisraeli phi yooniha aya milhatu chiheewananiya.<verse eid="RUT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Paahi yoyo ntu uyo aheerelha Naboazi, “Mwoopolheke imata iyo,” nkaarulha iratu awe ni waavaha Naboazi. <verse eid="RUT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Tho phi vavawo Naboazi venrelhe aya ashulhupalhe ni attu yaari vavawo ayo wiira, “Lhelho mwaatti phi attu nnoonechesha, nhoona mwaashinene wiira kihothuma imata wa Nanaomi. Chittu chonkhaye chaari chi Naelimeleki ni cha Nakilioni ni cha Namahaloni. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Wo uthepa vavawo, kihaakusha Naruthi, ntu o Umoabu, nankhwelhi a Namahaloni, wiira akhalhe ahanu aka. Wowo wiiwanana uwo uhopanga wiira nhakhu wa amuchi a ntu khwilhe ni nihimo naya uhalhe mmathathani mwaya vawani va. Mwaatti phi attu owoonechesha.”<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Paahi ashulhupalhe yaari vanlhakoni vamoka ni attu onkhaye yaari vavawo ayo nkayaakhulha, “Eiyo, hii phi noonechenshe. Apwiiya Nlhuku aavahereke ahanu inyu ayo ukhalha thoko chaari aya Naraheli ni Nalea. Onkhaye eelhi ayo yaari phi machokholhelho o makosho onkhaye o Israeli. Ni inyu nshichireke munlhokoni mwa attu o Uefratha, ni uchuwania Ubethlehemu. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Wo nlhatu wa achishaana anohalha inyu uvahiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku anohalha uyaria ni ulha nthiyana ulha, ni inupa inyu iweke yaakhalha thoko inupa i Naperesi mwaamwana mwanlhopwana a Nayuda ni ahanu aya, Natamari.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Naboazi ni iyari aya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Paahi etu Naboazi yahaakusha Naruthi ukhalha ahanu aya. Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaavahera Naruthi nkayaarupalha irukulhu, nkayannyara mwaana mwanlhopwana. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Phi vavawo manyoopani o yeyo iwani iyo verenlhe aya Nanaomi wiira, “Athimichiye Apwiiya Nlhuku ovahilheni mmuchi o ulhelhani! Ni uyo atotopelhiye chinene mwiilhaponi Uisraeli mwonkhaye. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Yoyo mwaana uyo nouhokolhosherani umwalhi inyu, ni ulhelhani vanohalha inyu wuulhuvalha, ukhalhawaya ahokohi inyu anouttunani ayo, ahonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana nohalha inyu unkhulhuvelha.” <verse eid="RUT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Paahi Nanaomi ahonkusha mwaana uyo nkayampakata ni unlhelha.<verse eid="RUT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Manyoopani amwaatamana yahomwiihana yoyo mwaana uyo nchina nawe Obedi, yeeraka wiira, “Mwaana hoyaria u Nanaomi.” Ni phi Naobedi aayanre Nayese, aayanre Adaudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Alha phi machina o iyari i Naperesi. Naperesi ahaayara Nahesroni, <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Nahesroni nkayaayara Narami. Ni Narami nkayaayara Naaminadabu, <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Naaminadabu nkayaayara Nanahishoni. Nanahishoni nkayaayara Nasalmoni, <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Nasalmoni nkayaayara Naboazi. Naboazi nkayaayara Naobedi, <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Naobedi nkayaayara Nayese. Ni Nayese yaayanre Adaudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>